WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
ano toki umareta no

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
あのとき生まれたの

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
I'll softly give you my thoughts

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
watashi no omoi sotto ageru

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
私の想いそっとあげる

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
That were born at that moment

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
shinjite ite

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
信じていて

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
Please believe in them

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
deatta hi kara

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
出逢った日から

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
Since the day when we met

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
hajimete no kimochi megutteru

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
初めての気持ち巡ってる

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
For the first time, I have these feelings, and they go around

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
honto no egao hoshii nante

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
ホントの笑顔ほしいなんて

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
I want your true smile

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
anata ga oshiete kureta sorao

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
あなたが教えてくれた空を

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
I embrace the sky

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
dakishimete yume o miru

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
抱きしめて夢をみる

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
That you told me about and dream

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
tooi keredo・・・

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
遠いけれど・・・

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
It's faraway, but...

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
atatakai hikari no kakera

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
あたたかい光のかけら

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
The fragments of warm light

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
kizutsuita hane ni inochi o kureta no

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
傷ついた羽根に命をくれたの

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
Gave life to my wounded wings

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
fureta toki umareta

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
触れたとき生まれた

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
Born at the moment when we touched

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
tsuyoi watashi no soba ni

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
強い私のそばに

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
Next to me, who is strong

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
mamoraretai watashi ga nemutte ita no

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
守られたいわたしが眠っていたの

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
The me who wants to be protected was asleep

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
sou unmei kaerareru ne

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
そう運命変えられるね

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
That's right, destiny can be changed

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
futari no koi mezamesasete・・・

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
ふたりの恋目覚めさせて・・・

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
Let our love awaken...

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:29.940
{last frame of OP}

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:35.030
These kinds of women do it knowing that they're being deceived.

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.690
Takashi, the truth is...

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:36.740
I just couldn't forget about you, Yasuko!

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:41.240
Third Episode 「Face of the Imposter」

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:36.740
Even though they know it?

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:37.820
Takashi...

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:42.830
Right, they're thinking "I've got to be with this person," and "If I'm patient enough..."

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:38.910
Yasuko...

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.200
Am I so...

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.830
I'm sorry, I...

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.950
Enough, enough already!

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:43.790
I don't get it.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:46.870
But you know, you just kind of want to treat them well.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.080
I...

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.040
Don't say it, it's enough.

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.040
You too, Tamaki?

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.420
Because...

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.790
I'm looking for a man who'll treat <i>me</i> well.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:52.290
I... I...

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:53.250
Wouldn't they be stupid, then?

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:55.510
Because you came back!

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.510
That kind of man is easy to be with.

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.510
I believed in you.

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.510
I don't know, I just can't understand.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.510
Thank you, Yasuko.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.090
You praise them a bit and they're all happy.

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:01.640
Takashi! Takashi!

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:02.930
How simple-minded. Are there even men like that?

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:02.470
Yasuko!

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:05.640
There's one who's surprisingly close.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.640
Even if you say the store's table broke,

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:10.190
isn't that called a necessary expense?

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:14.190
Just where did you learn such trifling knowledge?

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.820
Ah, but...

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.820
Either way, you did your job perfectly.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:19.450
Really?

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.160
Yes, you can be confident about it.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.700
Thank you very much.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.700
You've got to reimburse them, though.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:26.580
Ah, I see.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:27.750
That hurts.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.460
You just need to work harder next time.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.130
Yes, I will.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.590
So, I have another job.

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:34.750
Yes!

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.970
I want a convenient man as well.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.380
I think that kind of man is stupid.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:41.260
Do you want to go see?

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:42.890
Where?

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:46.270
This is good! Too good!

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:50.770
Thank goodness, you like eggs after all.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.770
Yeah, it's really good.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.310
Here's some tea.

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:55.650
Thanks.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.690
Is your job still tough?

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:03.910
No, it's totally fine. I made a mistake yesterday, but I have more confidence.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.080
That's wonderful.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.080
I guess this is thanks to the training I did at your house.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.670
It's because you worked hard.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.210
I've got to do my current job somehow.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:14.840
Your current one?

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.590
Ah, yes, it's a job as a bodyguard.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.220
Who are you protecting? A woman?

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:23.300
It's a man! An old man! A hateful one, too.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.140
Sounds tough.

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.770
It is, he's really selfish.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.560
He's really fussy?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.230
Yeah, we just can't get along.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:35.940
I have mail.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:37.980
Is it a job?

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.860
Ah, it's nothing.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.070
So you left the strap on?

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:44.780
Yeah, it's pretty useful.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:47.870
Isn't it? I really liked it.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.620
Sorry.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.210
Is it Murakami-san?

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.210
Hello?

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.750
Sorry, I'll call you back-

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.460
What?

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.290
I know.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.750
If you e-mailed me, then you didn't need to call as well.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.590
I thought you'd ignore me if I e-mailed you.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:01.720
I wouldn't.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.340
I wonder about that.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:05.430
What is it?

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:06.640
How indecent.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:07.260
What is?

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.970
That's Yuuno-senpai's, right?

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:09.560
So?

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.560
Indecent.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.730
Like I'm saying, what is?

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.140
You were in a situation where a call would've been bad, right?

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.020
That's not true.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:16.860
Did you eat it?

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.110
A bit.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.070
Was it bad?

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.360
I could only eat a bit before the call.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.490
I hate her.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.320
Hate her?

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.620
Everything she does is indecent.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.080
That's not true.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.910
Hey, what did you find out about the Kuhouins?

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.790
Give me some more time.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.580
Why did you call me, then?

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.010
It's a new job, could you look it over?

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:43.670
Okay.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:49.300
This is a pretty irksome building, though.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:51.770
We're in a world where individuality is lost.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.810
That's a real problem.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.560
That's why I became a nonconformist.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.480
You're a good woman too, Tamaki.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:02.650
All right, let's go find a good man.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.320
So it turned out like this?

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.410
It isn't because it's the kindergarten we went to together.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.410
I just couldn't stand it.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.750
It probably couldn't be helped.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:14.660
Why?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.790
Some building was knocked down for this kindergarten, too.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.460
It's not something that can stay around forever.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.010
So, you've become a person who can say even that.

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:26.430
Depends on the person, I guess.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:31.560
Last week, the land rights paperwork disappeared from the safe in the principal's house,

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.270
and in its place was his grandchild's picture.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.230
So they broke in.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.390
It was enough to scare him.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:38.520
I see.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.480
So that's how they are.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.780
What a terrible yard.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:47.650
Just what is the gardener here doing?

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.830
You said it once.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:57.830
You said, "Once I grow up, I'll take over the ramen shop with you, Ginko."

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.250
Yeah.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.500
Why?

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:04.420
Why are you working for Juuzawa Benika?

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.420
Forget about it.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:10.390
You hit, punch, and kick people, and endure it while in pain.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.060
You're an idiot.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.140
A real idiot.

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:16.930
You can't even do that kind of job.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.520
This is your job, isn't it?

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:21.400
Yeah.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.940
This is... tough...

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:27.990
Who are you?

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.030
My name is Kuhouin Murasaki.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:31.410
An elementary student?

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.700
You make an effort to study and to also train your body.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:35.580
I admire you all.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.290
It's practice, after all.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:43.290
But when will you head to Shinkurou's place, running around in circles in the same place?

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.670
Man, you're eating now?

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.050
I didn't have any time.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:50.680
That's Yuuno's, right?

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:52.010
Ah, well, yeah.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.430
How nice.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.220
Huh?

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:54.810
What?

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.560
There's an elementary student!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.020
You're right.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:06:59.520
There was?

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.480
She was running with them.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.690
She's probably someone's sister.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.440
Everyone's wearing the same clothes.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.690
It's our uniform, after all.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.150
Just like a servant.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.740
Right, that's because they're baseball players.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.740
Note: A pun on the word "kyuuji," which can mean servant or baseball player.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:12.740
Are they maids?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.280
Ah, I guess they do serve in a way.

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.580
I guess servants also do this kind of training.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.460
It's pretty tough.

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.830
I would think so.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:25.340
Next time, I will forgive my servants for their small mistakes.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.300
Yeah, please do.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.970
So, do you hold hot things with this?

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.340
I guess you could say it's hot.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.430
It's okay.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.760
I can clean it, at least.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.850
I said it's okay.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:39.680
Thanks.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.640
So, how were the side dishes?

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:44.440
They were really good.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:51.280
This water is terrible. Is it even water?

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.660
I just don't get it.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.160
That was really indecent.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.160
What was?

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:59.080
I was looking.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.540
Looking at what?

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:01.830
That strap...

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.870
Did you buy it?

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.250
Yeah.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.250
Where?

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:08.460
At Shin-Okubo.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.380
Idiot.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.630
What is this?

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.930
It's so dusty!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.690
This place is huge.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:32.820
Wouldn't an informer be the first one to be erased?

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.860
You watch too many movies.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:38.160
I'm able to do this job because of my grandpa, but

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.580
by having more information than anyone,

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:43.120
you can be the first one to run away before it gets dangerous, right?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.580
Really?

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.170
Are you worried about me?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.130
If I do my jobs properly, then there won't be any problems.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.260
Be careful.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:52.800
Yeah.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:54.720
Are you sleepy?

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:58.470
Yeah, today is really warm, huh?

00:08:58.890 --> 00:08:59.550
Yeah.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:04.230
This place has a peculiar smell.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:08.060
I just can't believe that Shinkurou has read all these books, though.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.820
This is just pitiful.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:16.070
Shinkurou won't be able to improve his paintings with things like this.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.530
He looks cool.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:19.990
Kunou Tadashi.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.660
He's the young boss of the Kyokuhou Group.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:23.540
That's surprising.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.040
There aren't as many people who you'd think are yakuza when you look at them these days.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.710
Aren't their looks important, though?

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:31.210
Are there people who would think that you're strong after looking at <i>you</i>?

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.420
Hey, are you okay?

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.090
Can you move?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.140
This is just terrible.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.140
It seems I've seen a horrifying aspect of the school.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.680
You're suffering, right? Just hold on.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:49.650
I know a reliab... No, only a somewhat reliable person.

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:52.190
Who's in trouble?

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.030
I think it's a man. He hasn't been answering the whole time.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:55.860
Did he collapse?

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:56.860
No, he's standing.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:57.740
{Huh!?}

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:01.740
I can see half of his body, and he's naked on top of being naked!

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:02.700
Naked?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.200
You're in Tamaki-san's room, right?

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.080
What?

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.250
Don't touch it!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.330
That's an indecent thing that bad adults use!

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.960
So he's Tamaki's?

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.340
Right, so don't touch it.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.130
But!

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:15.630
Don't!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.380
So, you're Tamaki's man?

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:23.180
Sorry, it seems that I can't get involved.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.470
No way...

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.270
That perverted woman...

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.310
Truly indecent.

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:30.770
Unbelievably indecent.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:31.860
It's not me!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:37.990
Hey.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.150
What?

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.820
What's your name, little girl?

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:45.370
Isn't it proper manners to introduce yourself before asking others?

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:48.750
You're right, sorry.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.580
I'm Houzuki Yuuno.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.830
I'm Kuhouin Murasaki.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.300
Kuhouin?

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:56.800
You've got it all wrong!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.550
Explain it to me.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.260
There are things that are hard to say, right?

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.220
I see, you're right.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.180
What is it?

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.800
Not telling.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:08.980
Hey, Murasaki-chan, why are you here?

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.310
Did you come to see someone?

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.230
What's that, Yuuno?

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.060
They're from the judo club.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.270
Wow, they're all huge!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.530
They have matches where they have to defeat their opponents, after all.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:19.900
Martial artists, right?

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.700
No, they're sportsmen.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:25.740
A real martial artist isn't like that.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.500
You know, I don't really mind it.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.410
Don't really mind what?

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:34.420
I'm fine with being in this lonely room and using the computer.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:37.000
When did you become an informant, again?

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:37.880
Who knows?

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.630
You're a real help, though.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:41.680
Is that why you started?

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:42.930
Don't be conceited.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:47.100
I'm only cooperating because I can't leave an idiot like you alone.

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:48.890
An idiot, huh?

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.480
I guess.

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:54.100
I'm going to go home now.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:54.730
Okay.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:56.480
If you get some new information-

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.820
I'll e-mail you.

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:00.030
Ah, you can call me too.

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:01.860
I'll e-mail you.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.240
Okay.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.370
What?

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:10.370
I'll call you when it's urgent.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.120
Okay, later.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:15.630
See you.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.840
This place called school is pretty mysterious.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.680
Is this your first time at a school?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.140
There's no need for me to go to school.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.980
Oh yeah, that's right.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.940
You're a girl from the Kuhouins, after all.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.740
You know about the Kuhouins?

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:42.740
A bit.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:44.700
Who... are you?

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:45.450
Who... are you?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.080
What was up with that?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.490
Probably someone's sister.

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:53.120
The way she talked was weird too.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.370
"My name is" or something.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:56.040
Yeah, that's it!

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.630
Everything she says is so grandiose.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.330
"My name is?"

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:00.090
"Are you performing something?" {need this to sound OJOU-SAMA/formal for the next line to work}

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:01.210
"Performing something?"

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.100
Naked...

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.760
On top of that, being naked?

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:15.890
Don't tell me...

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.610
I said earlier I was Houzuki Yuuno-

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:20.520
I don't know.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:25.740
I guess there are Kuhouins that don't recognize my last name too.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:26.990
Last name?

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.740
You have a cellphone?

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.570
It's probably Shinkurou.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.450
Shinkurou-san?

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.330
Hello?

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.620
Hello? Where are you right now?

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:35.660
At school.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:36.580
{Huh?}

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.290
I'm at your school.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.130
I thought so.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.290
Where in school?

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:42.130
I don't know.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:46.090
Eh? Eh? I don't know, everywhere looks the same to me.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.340
Shinkurou? You mean Kurenai Shinkurou?

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:49.760
Hey, where is this?

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:51.850
Let me talk, if it's Shinkurou-san.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.350
No, Shinkurou said I can't let anyone borrow it.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.310
I'm his acquaintance.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:01.900
Geez!

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:03.940
Hey, who are you talking to?

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.400
Some vile woman!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:07.400
I'm vile?

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.660
What can you see, Murasaki?

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:10.910
Hold on for a bit!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:11.780
Wait!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:14.990
Murasaki!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.210
Shinkurou-san?

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.000
Vile woman?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:20.540
Ah, no...

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.340
Stay away from that woman, Shinkurou!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:23.550
As I said, I'm...

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:24.960
She's a suspicious woman!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:25.880
So it was Yuuno-san.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.220
Shinkurou!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.090
I told you not to go out by yourself!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:30.430
That's why both of us came!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.180
With whom?

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.180
Hey...

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.180
Tamaki.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:35.850
What is she to you, Shinkurou-san?

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.680
Where's Tamaki-san?

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.850
Finding a man who 
would treat her well.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.390
That damn perverted woman.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.390
Perverted?

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:39.850
That's vulgar.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.850
Someone like Tamaki-san.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:44.320
You shouldn't talk like that in 
front of a child, Shinkurou-san.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.320
Don't treat me like a kid!

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:45.070
Yuuno-san...

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:47.940
Just how is she related to you?

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:48.950
Ah, that's...

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:49.650
We're living together.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.820
Living together?

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:51.820
Where did you learn those words?

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.120
Tamaki said it.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.830
Don't listen to what she says!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.830
Tamaki?

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.040
You're living with Tamaki?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.410
No, with her!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.040
That's right.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.710
You're living with someone this young?

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.920
No, that's not it, she's just a freeloader.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.830
No way, with this girl?

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:02.830
Freeloader?

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:03.590
Yuuno-san?

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:07.880
No wonder my devotion 
had no effect on you.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.880
Freeloader? What's a freeloader?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:08.800
You're getting it wrong.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.760
And of all things, this secret...

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:13.430
What did you do?! There's 
nothing to keep a secret!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.430
Please listen to me.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.430
Be quiet for a bit!

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:14.850
Why?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:17.220
I was hired to be her bodyguard.

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:21.140
Oh? Wasn't it supposed to 
be a hateful old man?

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:18.890
Hey, Shinkurou!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.140
Old man? An old man?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.190
Ah, that's...

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.320
Is it a job from Benika-san?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.360
Yeah, I couldn't refuse.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.900
Even so, you shouldn't lie.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:30.530
Yes.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:32.450
Lie?

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:35.160
What should you do at times like these?

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.790
I'm sorry for lying.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:43.000
You seem to have a lot going on, so I'll forgive you for today.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.130
I'm glad you understand.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.300
You really have it tough, huh?

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.550
It's my job after all.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.470
Come talk to me any time.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:51.130
Yes.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.720
Benika-san's a troublesome person.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:58.260
Yeah, but it also means that she trusts me.

00:15:58.260 --> 00:15:59.430
You're right.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:03.850
Shinkurou?

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:04.650
Yeah?

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:07.400
Am I a nuisance to you?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.320
Why?

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:10.990
Did I cause you trouble by going to school?

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.660
Trouble? You shouldn't end up by yourself if you go outside.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.620
Would it mean I broke our promise?

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.950
It was Tamaki-san's fault this time, so it's okay.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.290
You'll forgive me?

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.960
Don't do it again, though.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.080
Yeah!

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.290
It's my job to protect you, after all.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.300
Right...

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.880
You're with me because it's your job.

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:35.180
<i>And</i> it's a job from Benika.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:37.260
That's why you couldn't refuse.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.680
You get along well with Yuuno.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:42.560
Yeah.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:46.980
I lived at Yuuno-san's place up until last year.

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:47.690
Really?

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:52.320
Her grandfather taught me martial arts.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.320
It's called Houzuki-ryuu.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.320
It's a power I need for my job.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.540
You don't laugh like that with me.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:03.580
What?

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.120
It's nothing.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.880
You don't seem well, are you hungry?

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.290
This chair isn't comfortable.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.010
That's...

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.380
I said to move it.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.090
Hurry and get up.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.430
I'm tired, you know.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.510
That's right, students get tired too.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.600
Club activities have me really tired.

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.180
The dash really gets to you.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.770
Yeah, it's totally bad, and we went on for 50 minutes.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.650
It's way above your limits.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.780
Shinkurou.

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.690
We're getting off soon.

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.690
You okay, lady?

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:36.030
Why don't you move somewhere else?

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:36.650
I'm sorry.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:37.700
Shinkurou.

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.370
The next stop.

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.530
There, go over there.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:42.990
Hey!

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:44.370
Be ashamed of yourselves!

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.210
What?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.710
What have you been learning at that age?

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.750
Bullying others is the worst thing a person can do!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.050
What's with this kid?

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.090
Tell her off.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.300
She's just a brat.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.800
You're the brats!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.890
You're getting annoying.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.390
Give her your seat now!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:01.800
Ah, it's a bother.

00:18:01.800 --> 00:18:02.510
Go away.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.810
You go away!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.430
Huh? I'll seriously hit you.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.980
Getting serious with a kid?

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:07.520
Damn trash.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:10.810
Don't touch me!

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.900
I don't want trash like you to tou-

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.190
Sorry about that.

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:16.490
Shinkurou! Hey!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:17.780
Who are you?

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:20.110
Let go! Let go, Shinkurou!

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:21.820
Please let her go. She's still young and naive.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.820
Shinkurou!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:22.830
I'm really sorry.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:25.450
Let go! Let go!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:24.620
What are you? Her guardian?

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:25.450
You serious?

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.700
Yes, that's right.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.410
Really sorry about-

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.250
Shinkurou!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.130
You can take this much, right?

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.510
Yes, sorry, I'm sorry.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:36.340
Don't apologize!

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.220
I'm really sorry.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.180
I'll scold her.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.970
Enough, go away now.

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:44.310
Yes, sorry about that.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.400
You know, you shouldn't be so reckless.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.030
What's there to think about when it's the right thing to do?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.150
It's not that simp-

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:00.530
You learned martial arts at Yuuno's house, right?

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.570
For what reason?

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:02.660
To fight.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.740
Then use it right now!

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.040
Enough, let's go home.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.040
Don't change the subject!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:09.250
You can't just fight anywhere.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.330
Why not?

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.630
There are times you can resolve things by apologizing, right?

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:16.090
There's no need! Aren't you ashamed, doing that with that face of yours?

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:16.800
Face?

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.510
Your ugly smile!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.880
What are you talking about?

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.930
You put on that forced smile of yours.

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:24.470
Okay, that's enough, let's go home.

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.350
That smile of yours is just weird!

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:29.520
You laugh when you have fun! When you're happy!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:31.520
I hate that fake smile!

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.690
I can't fight when you're there.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.150
Don't you find yourself pathetic? Don't you have any confidence?

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:39.030
I do! That's why I'm protecting you.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:41.650
That's a lie! You're doing it because Benika requested it!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.200
I accepted because I have confidence.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.820
Is listening to Benika all you can do?

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:47.450
No, I just don't want to have meaningless fights.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:48.620
It's not meaningless!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.660
You wouldn't understand!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:54.210
I can't take how you think you're right each and every time!

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:57.630
And that's how you run away! You just smile when you're troubled to deceive others!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:00.420
No! You'll understand when you're older.

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.180
That's unfair!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.590
You're just ignorant of how society works.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:05.390
We're going home now.

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:11.640
My mother smiled like that in front of that woman, too.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:14.810
I hate it...

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:16.650
I hate it...

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.110
I hate that face...

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:25.450
I hate how she died with that face on...

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:27.910
Excuse me.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:34.250
Please don't fight, I'm fine.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:35.670
You weren't fine.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.090
That's not true, little lady.

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.090
Really?

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.710
Yes, really. Thank you.

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.090
That's great.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.590
For a small person, you're splendid.

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:48.600
Being small is no problem.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:51.140
You're right. How old are you?

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.350
Seven years old.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:55.900
Yes!

00:20:58.270 --> 00:20:59.020
Yeah.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:02.440
I got it.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:04.200
Office?

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:06.450
Yeah.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:10.200
I know, I'll be fine.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:13.790
I'll finish it before morning.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.500
I'll e-mail you when it's all over.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:15.500
What's going on?

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:17.540
Yeah.

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:20.210
Later.

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:51.160
What's Shinkurou doing, leaving me alone in the night?

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:00.210
Yeah.

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:04.800
I see, it's probably a job from Ginko.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:05.920
I don't mind.

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:08.180
Yeah.

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:11.600
Fine, but don't intervene unless it's absolutely necessary.

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:15.060
I'll leave the basics to you, so judge for yourself.

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:16.600
Right.

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:18.440
Bye.

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:23.730
Everyone's being so childish.

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:28.820
I guess I don't need it.

